{"nodes": [{"id": "templates_skill_template_skill_skill_template", "label": "skill-template/SKILL.md \u2014 skill authoring starter", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "templates/skill-template/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L1-L41", "rationale": "Fixes the SKILL.md shape every lirbox skill instantiates: third-person trigger description, When to use (including what it is NOT for so it doesn't fire on adjacent tasks), Inputs with defaults, imperative numbered Workflow, a verification step, and a Quality bar.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "templates_skill_template_skill_bundled_resources", "label": "Bundled resources convention (scripts / references / assets)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "templates/skill-template/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L35-L40", "rationale": "Three directories with distinct context costs: scripts/ is deterministic runnable code that never enters context, references/ is loaded on demand to keep SKILL.md lean, assets/ feeds the skill's OUTPUT and is never loaded into context. Splitting this way is what keeps the always-loaded surface small.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "templates_skill_template_skill_verify_before_claiming_done", "label": "Verify before claiming done (evidence before assertions)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "templates/skill-template/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L28-L30", "rationale": "Every skill must spell out the checks that prove its output is correct, so completion claims rest on evidence rather than on the model's confidence.", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "templates_skill_template_skill_skill_template", "target": "templates_skill_template_skill_bundled_resources", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "templates/skill-template/SKILL.md", "source_lo